might require additional knowledge of relevant regulations or computer skills.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistant Engineer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>Bachelor of Engineering (B.E.)/Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech.)</strong>\u00a0in the specific engineering discipline (e.g., Civil, Electrical, Mechanical). Some posts may also accept a Master\u2019s degree.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Biomedical Engineer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>Bachelor of Engineering (B.E.)/Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech.)</strong>\u00a0in Biomedical Engineering or a related field.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : </span></strong><strong><a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/rsmssb-surveyor-and-mines-supervisor-online-form-2024/\">RSMSSB Surveyor and Mines Supervisor Recruitment 2025</a></strong></span>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff